# Frontend Architecture

The frontend is a React application with a retro-style UI featuring robot avatars and a chat interface for interacting with the MCP agent.

## Main Components

- [frontend/src/components/App.jsx](mdc:frontend/src/components/App.jsx) - Main application component that orchestrates the chat interface
- [frontend/src/components/ChatHistory.jsx](mdc:frontend/src/components/ChatHistory.jsx) - Component for displaying the chat history
- [frontend/src/components/LeftRobot.jsx](mdc:frontend/src/components/LeftRobot.jsx) - Component for the questioner robot avatar
- [frontend/src/components/RightRobot.jsx](mdc:frontend/src/components/RightRobot.jsx) - Component for the answerer robot avatar

## Entry Point

- [frontend/src/index.js](mdc:frontend/src/index.js) - Main entry point for the React application

## Services

The frontend/src/services directory contains utility services for:
- API communication
- Socket.IO integration
- State management

## Styling

The application uses a retro-style design with custom CSS for the robot avatars and chat interface, found in the [frontend/src/styles](mdc:frontend/src/styles) directory.

## Configuration

- [frontend/package.json](mdc:frontend/package.json) - Package configuration and dependencies

## Planning

- [frontend-plan.md](mdc:frontend-plan.md) - Design and implementation plan for the frontend
